    "_id": "68de0001a1b2c3d4e5f60003",
    "title": "Spodify",
    "description": "A free Spotify alternative for Android, built in React Native. Streams the full YouTube Music catalogue with search, playlists, artist pages and a personal library, and imports your Spotify account so existing playlists and liked songs carry over. Delivers what a subscription normally gates — offline downloads, time-synced lyrics from LRCLIB that self-correct against the real track duration, listening stats, and background playback with lock-screen controls — with all state held in on-device SQLite. Release builds ship through a signed APK pipeline hardened with R8 full mode and Hermes bytecode.",
