    "description": "OpenAI-compatible LLM API gateway that routes one interface across multiple providers — Groq, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenAI, Cerebras and more. Routes each request to the fastest healthy provider from historical latency and error rates, fails over instantly when a provider errors or times out, and exposes image generation and text-to-speech endpoints alongside chat completions. MongoDB-backed client API keys, admin key issuance, and per-request token, latency and cost analytics.",
